course: dictionary
lesson: 6039
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the sentence tells you which one is meant. The word mem is a good example. It can be a Hebrew letter, a short form in notes, or an old word for a lady in India.
explain: Look at the clues around the word. «That is why our A began as an ox's head («alp» meant ox), B as a house («bet»), M as wavy water («mem») and O as an eye.» Here the words about letters, ox and house tell you that mem is a letter with a history, so it means the Hebrew letter.
explain: When you meet a word with several meanings, try each meaning in the sentence and see which one fits. A note that says «Mem. 4, page 2» is a short form of memory or member, not a letter. Context always decides.
fact: Mem is a noun. Its plural is mems.
fact: Mem is the thirteenth letter of the Hebrew alphabet, written מ.
fact: In Bible studies, Hebrew letters such as mem head the parts of Psalm 119.
fact: In notes, «mem.» can be a short form of memory or member.
fact: In old stories about British India, a «mem» or «memsahib» was a European lady, and servants used the word when speaking to her.
exercise: «That is why our A began as an ox's head («alp» meant ox), B as a house («bet»), M as wavy water («mem») and O as an eye.» In this sentence, mem means | A house | An eye | An ox's head | *The thirteenth letter of the Hebrew alphabet
exercise: In Bible studies, what are Hebrew letters such as mem used for? | To write a shopping list | *To head the parts of Psalm 119 | To count the members of a choir | To show the weather in a story
exercise: In notes, «mem.» can be a short form of which two words? | *Memory or member | Money or mend | Mountain or mouse | Meadow or meal
test: In old stories about British India, what was a «mem» or memsahib? | *A European lady | A computer memory chip | A type of ox | A Hebrew letter
test: Which word for mem fits computer talk? | *Memory | Memo in a school office | Member | Memsahib
exam: Which meaning of mem is a Hebrew letter written מ? | *The thirteenth letter of the Hebrew alphabet | A cut-off part of a memo | A short form of memsahib used by servants | An old word for an ox
